{"id":"01M1TX41ESCGCZ12RD1XY845JX","ts":"2026-09-06T08:24:53.465Z","task":"TL-288","field":"__decision__","from":"","to":"Profiles live in one local agent-profiles.yaml file beside the user config. It uses a narrow profiles list of flat records, and the profile create, list, show, update and remove commands are the only writer. This is readable and diffable, preserves existing preferences, keeps every provider as an opaque adapter command, and gives duplicate names a visible validation path.","actor":"agent:codex","source":"decide","reason":"Profiles live in one local agent-profiles.yaml file beside the user config. It uses a narrow profiles list of flat records, and the profile create, list, show, update and remove commands are the only writer. This is readable and diffable, preserves existing preferences, keeps every provider as an opaque adapter command, and gives duplicate names a visible validation path.","session":"tree-526f61f2043f"}
